1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,785
Wait, this line has not been said
yet.

2
00:00:02,785 --> 00:00:04,824
[Overlapping rehearsal dialogue]

3
00:00:04,824 --> 00:00:05,745
I said it.

4
00:00:05,745 --> 00:00:07,345
It is done. You just said it.

5
00:00:07,345 --> 00:00:10,145
I’m told to pull him. He stays
seated for the line.

6
00:00:10,425 --> 00:00:12,544
Right, say it sitting down.

7
00:00:12,544 --> 00:00:16,745
At this point… am I out of the
shot?

8
00:00:16,745 --> 00:00:20,845
[Overlapping discussion of framing
and position]

9
00:00:20,845 --> 00:00:23,044
There is only a voice.

10
00:00:24,044 --> 00:00:27,645
[Continuing to rehearse the lines]

11
00:00:27,645 --> 00:00:29,645
Go on ahead. I can manage on my
own.

12
00:00:31,145 --> 00:00:35,044
At this point, we hear a door
opening. We only need the sound.

13
00:00:35,044 --> 00:00:35,973
Don’t leave.

14
00:00:35,973 --> 00:00:40,453
But at that point, there is nobody
in your shot.

15
00:00:40,453 --> 00:00:44,453
The whole room is dark and empty.

16
00:00:44,453 --> 00:00:47,293
Then a single light shines down.

17
00:00:47,293 --> 00:00:49,593
You call out: "Are you there?"

18
00:00:53,408 --> 00:00:54,408
Are you there?

19
00:00:55,288 --> 00:00:56,288
Are you there?

20
00:00:59,308 --> 00:01:00,308
[A quiet reply]

21
00:01:03,388 --> 00:01:04,588
Are you sad?

22
00:01:07,488 --> 00:01:08,748
Are you sad?
